IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `ito-il27-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-il27-tax-years`
IMPORT `ito-s39b-combat-reservist`
IMPORT `ito-credit-points-published-figures`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Tests for s 39B. Row IL-27. Expected values worked by hand from lines 1620-1626 before the rules were run; none edited.
-- Paragraphs (1) and (2): 0 below 20 days; 3/4 at 20; plus 1/4 for each complete five days beyond 20; at most 4.
-- Temporary provision (2026, 2027): 0 below 20 (nothing is said, nothing given); 20-29 not said; 1/2 at 30-39; 3/4 at 40-49;
-- 1 at 50, plus 1/4 for each complete five days beyond 50; at most 4.
-- ===========================================================================

§ `Tests — section 39B`

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `resident` IS A BOOLEAN
      `days`     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A combat reservist in a tax year, for section 39B`
`in` `the year` `, resident:` `resident` `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` `days` MEANS
    `A combat reservist in a tax year, for section 39B` OF `the year`, `resident`, `days`, FALSE

GIVEN `the year` IS A NUMBER
      `days`     IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `A combat reservist in a tax year, for section 39B`
`a foreign worker in` `the year` `with reserve service of` `days` MEANS
    `A combat reservist in a tax year, for section 39B` OF `the year`, TRUE, `days`, TRUE

§§ `Paragraphs (1) and (2), in a year the temporary provision does not govern (2028)`

-- 19 days: below 20, nothing. 20 days: 3/4. 24: still 3/4 (four days beyond 20 are not a block of five). 25: 3/4 + 1/4 = 1.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 19) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 20) EQUALS 3/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 24) EQUALS 3/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 25) EQUALS 1
-- 30 days: 10 beyond 20 = two blocks: 3/4 + 2/4 = 5/4. 39 days: 19 beyond = three blocks: 3/4 + 3/4 = 3/2. 40 days: four blocks: 3/4 + 1 = 7/4.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 30) EQUALS 5/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 39) EQUALS 3/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) EQUALS 7/4
-- The ceiling of 4 points: 84 days is 64 beyond 20 = 12 blocks: 3/4 + 3 = 15/4; 85 days is 13 blocks: 3/4 + 13/4 = 4; 100 days would be 4.75, held to 4.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 84) EQUALS 15/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 85) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 100) EQUALS 4

§§ `Fork F2 — the temporary provision in the tax years 2026 and 2027`

-- 40 days in 2026: replace reading 3/4 (the 40-49 tier); paragraphs (1) and (2) throughout 7/4; the default declines.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) EQUALS 3/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `paragraphs (1) and (2) govern in every tax year` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) EQUALS 7/4
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) BECAUSE "section 39B does not say how its temporary provision for tax years 2026 and 2027 relates to paragraphs (1) and (2), and here the readings differ"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) BECAUSE "section 39B does not say how its temporary provision for tax years 2026 and 2027 relates to paragraphs (1) and (2), and here the readings differ"
-- The tiers of the temporary provision, in 2027: 30 -> 1/2, 39 -> 1/2, 40 -> 3/4, 49 -> 3/4, 50 -> 1, 54 -> 1, 55 -> 5/4.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 30) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 39) EQUALS 1/2
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 49) EQUALS 3/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 50) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 54) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 55) EQUALS 5/4
-- 109 days: 59 beyond 50 = 11 blocks: 1 + 11/4 = 15/4. 110: 12 blocks: 4. 120: 14 blocks would be 4.5, held to 4.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 109) EQUALS 15/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 110) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 120) EQUALS 4
-- 25 days: the temporary provision says nothing of 20 to 29; paragraphs (1) and (2) give 1; the default declines in the fork's words.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `the temporary provision replaces paragraphs (1) and (2) in tax years 2026 and 2027` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 25) BECAUSE "the temporary provision of section 39B says nothing of 20 to 29 days of service"
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `paragraphs (1) and (2) govern in every tax year` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 25) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 25) BECAUSE "section 39B does not say how its temporary provision for tax years 2026 and 2027 relates to paragraphs (1) and (2), and here the readings differ"
-- Under 20 days every reading gives nothing, and the default answers.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 10) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `section 39B — the reading row IL-27 takes of the temporary provision` EQUALS `declined where the readings differ`

§§ `Tax year, residence, foreign worker`

-- Before 2026: the commencement is not in the sources. Before 2024: the row's general gate.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2025 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) BECAUSE "the commencement of section 39B is in an amending Law that is not in the source bundle, so a tax year before 2026 is not answered"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2023 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) BECAUSE "row IL-27 does not hold the text of these sections for a tax year before 2024"
-- 2028, 40 days (7/4 on the text): a non-resident declines by default; the readings by name.
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` FALSE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) BECAUSE "sections 39A, 39B, 40A and 40B name no residence condition, and here residence decides"
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `declined where the readings differ` `and the residence condition as` `no residence condition` `, for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` FALSE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) EQUALS 7/4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B, reading the temporary provision as` `declined where the readings differ` `and the residence condition as` `an Israeli resident only` `, for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` FALSE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` FALSE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 10) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`a foreign worker in` 2028 `with reserve service of` 40) BECAUSE "section 48A and the regulations made under it are not encoded in this model"
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`a foreign worker in` 2028 `with reserve service of` 10) EQUALS 0

§§ `The credit in NIS`

-- 2028, 40 days: 7/4 points at the 2025 published value of 2,904: 7/4 x 2,904 = 5,082.
#ASSERT `the credit under section 39B, in NIS, for` (`in` 2028 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 40) `, at a credit-point value of` (`the value of one credit point published by the Israel Tax Authority for tax year` 2025) EQUALS 5082

§§ `v0.1.1 — the default declines only where the readings differ`

-- 200 days in 2027: paragraphs (1) and (2) cap at 4 (from 85 days) and the temporary provision caps at 4 (from 110 days): the readings agree, 4.
-- 110 days: (1)-(2) give 3/4 + 18/4, held to 4; the temporary provision gives 1 + 15/4, held to 4: 4. 109 days: (1)-(2) 4; temporary 1 + 11/4 = 15/4: they differ. 100 days: 4 against 1 + 10/4 = 7/2: differ.
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 200) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2026 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 110) EQUALS 4
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 109) BECAUSE "section 39B does not say how its temporary provision for tax years 2026 and 2027 relates to paragraphs (1) and (2), and here the readings differ"
#ASSERT REFUSED `the credit points under section 39B for` (`in` 2027 `, resident:` TRUE `; fighter's reserve service in the previous year, in days:` 100) BECAUSE "section 39B does not say how its temporary provision for tax years 2026 and 2027 relates to paragraphs (1) and (2), and here the readings differ"
